	(text "Normal-voltage mode: VDDH tied to VDD (3V3 from U4), DCCH unused.\nREG1 DC/DC enabled in firmware (L2/L3) to cut radio current.\nDEC2/DEC5: not connected (nRF52840 build code Fxx and later).\nP0.09/P0.10 are used as GPIO: set CONFIG_NFCT_PINS_AS_GPIOS.\nP0.18/RESET is an inner aQFN pad -> not used (power-cycle with SW101).\nBootloader: flash over SWD (J3), then USB DFU / &bootloader key." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 495.3 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "03fe4b74-dc81-44f4-ab20-1688e8f3e450"))
