	(text "Matrix: 6 rows x 16 columns, 84 keys, diodes COL -> ROW  (ZMK: diode-direction = \"col2row\").\nColumns driven, rows read with pull-downs.  Every switch has its own 1N4148W (full NKRO).\nSwitch footprints: Kailh MX hot-swap sockets (project lib keyboard75.pretty), keycap size\n1u ... 6.25u; Cherry PCB-mount stabiliser holes built into the 2u / 2.25u / 6.25u footprints.\nPassives 0402 unless noted;  4.7uF / 10uF = 0603 X5R." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 418 331.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b0ac4d4-90b7-46d3-a818-b8c80fa878dd"))
